+- Crystallization (`arXiv:2608.07213`) motivates separate replay,
+  same-template, and unseen-family results.
+- CoBa (`arXiv:2608.07424`) motivates a fixed-budget generation, verification,
+  and stop control in the live benchmark.
+- Solver-Guided Diffusion Reasoning (`OpenReview nOThfUG7eS`) motivates an
+  exact-feedback refinement loop. It is a position paper. V542 makes no
+  diffusion-model claim.
